WEBVTT

01:04:25.954 --> 01:04:31.496
It is mind boggling that that happens that
way and it happens again and again.

01:04:31.496 --> 01:04:35.204
So you've seen so many of these stories
happen. What would you say?

01:04:35.704 --> 01:04:43.746
Is the is there a key thing that
differentiates good entrepreneurs from

01:04:44.121 --> 01:04:47.663
others? If you could double down
on one trait, what would it be?

01:04:48.413 --> 01:04:51.246
If I could pick only one, I
would pick determination.

01:04:52.621 --> 01:04:54.621
I think that is the biggest
predictor of success,

01:04:54.621 --> 01:04:56.496
the biggest differentiator predictor.

01:04:56.996 --> 01:04:58.496
And if you would allow a second,

01:04:58.871 --> 01:05:02.621
I would pick like communication
skills or evangelism